        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: చిత్రలేఖనం",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "చిత్రలేఖనం — citralēkhanaṁ — \"the art of painting\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నా చెల్లెలు చిత్రలేఖనం నేర్చుకుంటోంది. nā cellelu citralēkhanaṁ nērcukuṇṭōndi. My younger sister is learning to paint."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "చిత్రం, picture, + లేఖనం, drawing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "చిత్రలేఖనం (citralēkhanaṁ) is a learned compound built from Sanskrit citra, \"bright, variegated\" (CDIAL 4803), and lēkhana, \"scraping\", the noun of the root of writing (CDIAL 11103)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
